---
layout: blog-base.njk
permalink: /blog/index.html
navCurrent: blog
title: "Blog"
metaTitle: "Blog - Mario Christ"
description: "Notizen aus der Praxis: lokale Sprachmodelle, Datenschutz, Infrastruktur."
---
    <!-- ── Block 1: Kopf (dunkel) ────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="section section--dark blog-hero" aria-label="Blog">
      <div class="container blog-hero__inner">
        <span class="accent-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h1 class="blog-hero__title">Blog</h1>
        <p class="blog-hero__sub">Notizen aus der Praxis. Was ich baue, was dabei schiefgeht und was davon übrig bleibt: lokale Sprachmodelle, Datenschutz, Infrastruktur.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Block 2: Beitragsliste (hell) ─────────────────── -->
    <section class="section blog-list" aria-label="Beiträge">
      <div class="container blog-list__inner">
{% if collections.posts | length %}
        <ol class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
          <li class="post-list__item">
            <p class="post-list__meta">
              <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateDE }}</time>
            </p>
            <h2 class="post-list__title">
              <a class="post-list__link" href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
            </h2>
{% if post.data.description %}
            <p class="post-list__excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
{% endif %}
{% if post.data.tags %}
            <ul class="post-tags" aria-label="Themen">
{% for tag in post.data.tags %}
              <li class="post-tags__item">{{ tag }}</li>
{% endfor %}
            </ul>
{% endif %}
          </li>
{% endfor %}
        </ol>
{% else %}
        <p class="blog-list__empty">Hier steht noch nichts.</p>
{% endif %}

        <p class="blog-list__feed">
          <a class="link-external" href="{{ site.blog.feed }}">Feed abonnieren&nbsp;→</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
